# Uptime Kuma monitors

List and craft monitors, status pages, and notification channels. Prefer MCP
when connected (`global-mcp-first`); else the product API or authenticated UI.

Never invent monitor / tag / status-page ids — list/resolve first. Resolve the
instance base URL from operator config — do not hardcode hosts. After create or
update, report name + type + target + status (no tokens).
